{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"rows\": [\n    {\n      \"form\": \"连贯\",\n      \"text\": \"想起从前那些自然亲近的日子，他心里又热了起来，也盼着以后还能有那样的相处；先前那种柔软的歌唱重新出现，像一支温柔的歌忽然站到了明亮处，也带出一种公开的气势；柔软没有被力量压下去，反而也被带进高潮。\",\n      \"keys\": [\n        \"心里又热了起来\",\n        \"站到了明亮处\"\n      ],\n      \"emotion\": \"炽热\",\n      \"from\": [\n        \"S13-1\",\n        \"S13-B1\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"form\": \"散落\",\n      \"items\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"像私下安慰、近乎祈祷\",\n          \"from\": [\n            \"S13-B1\"\n          ],\n          \"bars\": \"254–270\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"像心脏以最高负荷跳\",\n          \"from\": [\n            \"S13-B1\"\n          ],\n          \"bars\": \"254–270\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"想到故土和共同记忆\",\n          \"from\": [\n            \"S13-B1\"\n          ],\n          \"bars\": \"254–270\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"还有希望\",\n          \"from\": [\n            \"S13-B1\"\n          ],\n          \"bars\": \"254–270\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"form\": \"连贯\",\n      \"text\": \"这么想着，他倒真有了劲头，想把往后的日子好好过起来，不再整天跟从前的事较劲；可这股冲势没有一直持续，劲头稍缓时，他又怕还要等很久，才能再遇上那样亲近的人，心里渐渐静了下来。\",\n      \"keys\": [\n        \"有了劲头\",\n        \"怕还要等很久\"\n      ],\n      \"emotion\": \"悬着\",\n      \"from\": [\n        \"S13-2\",\n        \"S13-3\",\n        \"S13-B2\",\n        \"S13-B3\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"form\": \"散落\",\n      \"items\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"兴奋得来不及喘息\",\n          \"from\": [\n            \"S13-B2\"\n          ],\n          \"bars\": \"269–280\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"刚刚建立的成功\",\n          \"from\": [\n            \"S13-B3\"\n          ],\n          \"bars\": \"281–285\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"被轻轻问起\",\n          \"from\": [\n            \"S13-B3\"\n          ],\n          \"bars\": \"281–285\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"真的已经牢固了吗？\",\n          \"from\": [\n            \"S13-B3\"\n          ],\n          \"bars\": \"281–285\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"像事情说完了\",\n          \"from\": [\n            \"S13-B3\"\n          ],\n          \"bars\": \"281–287\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"终于能停下喘口气\",\n          \"from\": [\n            \"S13-B3\"\n          ],\n          \"bars\": \"281–287\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"从容和不安并存\",\n          \"from\": [\n            \"S13-B3\"\n          ],\n          \"bars\": \"281–287\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"平静不等于没疑问\",\n          \"from\": [\n            \"S13-B3\"\n          ],\n          \"bars\": \"281–287\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"form\": \"连贯\",\n      \"text\": \"将来要是再有人愿意把他当自己人，他会好好珍惜；即使一直没有，他也愿意自己好好过下去，不再为了留住谁把那些委屈咽下去。\",\n      \"keys\": [\n        \"把他当自己人\",\n        \"不再为了留住谁把那些委屈咽下去\"\n      ],\n      \"emotion\": \"安心\",\n      \"from\": [\n        \"S13-4\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"notes\": [\n    {\n      \"text\": \"开阔音响如管风琴般庄严庞大\",\n      \"bars\": \"254–270\",\n      \"from\": [\n        \"S13-B1\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"密集音符像狂飙激流喷向天空\",\n      \"bars\": \"254–270\",\n      \"from\": [\n        \"S13-B1\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"快速炫目八度明亮迅疾向前冲\",\n      \"bars\": \"269–280\",\n      \"from\": [\n        \"S13-B2\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"气流推着身体跑，几乎喘不过气\",\n      \"bars\": \"269–280\",\n      \"from\": [\n        \"S13-B2\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"颤动装饰音重新带来不安\",\n      \"bars\": \"281–285\",\n      \"from\": [\n        \"S13-B3\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"回落像终于能停下喘口气\",\n      \"bars\": \"281–287\",\n      \"from\": [\n        \"S13-B3\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"低音区像呼出最后一口气\",\n      \"bars\": \"286–288\",\n      \"from\": [\n        \"S13-B4\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"沉沉吐出两记耳语般和弦\",\n      \"bars\": \"286–288\",\n      \"from\": [\n        \"S13-B4\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"最高音区亮起透明寒星和弦\",\n      \"bars\": \"286–288\",\n      \"from\": [\n        \"S13-B4\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"高音和弦像一声清脆钟响\",\n      \"bars\": \"286–288\",\n      \"from\": [\n        \"S13-B4\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"高音和弦可听作一个决定\",\n      \"bars\": \"286–288\",\n      \"from\": [\n        \"S13-B5\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"也可听作忽然从梦中醒来\",\n      \"bars\": \"286–288\",\n      \"from\": [\n        \"S13-B5\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b6b5f878-0edf-4bea-9e14-fa8fc9590e32", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261109T223356392742Z", "elapsed_seconds": 257.047, "completed_utc": "2026-11-09T22:38:13.463253+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "da3c9f081d4a819099a140ba010c6463d55119508f31123d4d382ce86dcc1902", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144